OL,3,AIsraeli air strike kills Hamas internal
OL,4,Asecurity chief in Gaza
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Israeli air strike has killed the
OL,7,Fhead of Hamas's internal security
OL,8,Fservice in Gaza.
OL,10,FGaza's Hamas-run interior ministry said
OL,11,FNaeem Abu Nahel was targeted by an
OL,12,Faircraft in western Gaza City. The
OL,13,F50-year-old had only been in the
OL,14,Fposition since September, when his
OL,15,Fpredecessor was captured in a raid by
OL,16,FIsraeli special forces.
OL,18,FIsraeli Prime Minister Benjamin
OL,19,FNetanyahu and Defence Minister Israel
OL,20,FKatz announced that Abu Nahel had been
OL,21,F"eliminated" by the Israeli military.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
