OL,3,AIsraeli air strike kills Hamas internal
OL,4,Asecurity chief in Gaza
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier, Palestinian first responders
OL,7,Fand health officials reported that six
OL,8,Fother people had been killed in two
OL,9,FIsraeli air strikes elsewhere in Gaza
OL,10,Fon Tuesday.
